@startuml
title Synopsis Generator - Компоненты
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Synopsis Generator" as SG {
    [FastAPI] as API
    [LangGraph StateGraph] as Graph
    [MCP Client\nMultiServerMCPClient] as Client
    [Logger] as Logger
}

package "Synopsis MCP Server" as MCP {
    [FastMCP] as FastMCP
    [MCP Tools] as Tools
    [Services] as Services
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB
cloud "Ollama" as Ollama

API --> Graph : invoke / resume
Graph --> Ollama : ChatOllama
Graph --> Client : load/call tools
Client --> FastMCP : HTTP MCP
FastMCP --> Tools
Tools --> Services
Services --> DB : domain persistence
Services --> API : health check
Services --> Ollama : health check
API --> DB : AsyncPostgresSaver
Graph ..> Logger
API ..> Logger

note right of DB
    Одна БД содержит:
    - LangGraph checkpoint tables
    - story_projects
    - synopsis_generations
    - story_memory_versions
end note

@enduml
